 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In nineteen thirty-two,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.242
  },
  {
   "text": "Australia declared war on birds.",
   "s": 1.409,
   "e": 3.431
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty thousand emus were wrecking the wheat farms in Western Australia,",
   "s": 3.817,
   "e": 7.627
  },
  {
   "text": "and desperate farmers begged the army for help.",
   "s": 7.798,
   "e": 10.432
  },
  {
   "text": "So the government sent soldiers,",
   "s": 10.777,
   "e": 12.729
  },
  {
   "text": "two machine guns,",
   "s": 12.95,
   "e": 14.009
  },
  {
   "text": "and ten thousand bullets.",
   "s": 14.23,
   "e": 15.711
  },
  {
   "text": "Against emus.",
   "s": 16.045,
   "e": 16.937
  },
  {
   "text": "But emus are fast,",
   "s": 17.318,
   "e": 18.427
  },
  {
   "text": "and they don't stay put.",
   "s": 18.595,
   "e": 19.887
  },
  {
   "text": "Whenever the soldiers aimed,",
   "s": 20.265,
   "e": 21.69
  },
  {
   "text": "the birds scattered in every direction,",
   "s": 21.876,
   "e": 23.879
  },
  {
   "text": "and sprinted away.",
   "s": 24.064,
   "e": 25.197
  },
  {
   "text": "One gunner even mounted a machine gun on a truck.",
   "s": 25.534,
   "e": 28.112
  },
  {
   "text": "But the truck bounced so much over the rough ground,",
   "s": 28.463,
   "e": 31.069
  },
  {
   "text": "he couldn't hit a single bird.",
   "s": 31.295,
   "e": 33.007
  },
  {
   "text": "After a week,",
   "s": 33.346,
   "e": 34.137
  },
  {
   "text": "the army had used up thousands of bullets,",
   "s": 34.365,
   "e": 36.688
  },
  {
   "text": "and the emus were barely scratched.",
   "s": 36.857,
   "e": 38.626
  },
  {
   "text": "The soldiers pulled out.",
   "s": 39.009,
   "e": 40.262
  },
  {
   "text": "The press roared with laughter,",
   "s": 40.61,
   "e": 41.958
  },
  {
   "text": "and an officer admitted the emus fought like tanks.",
   "s": 42.162,
   "e": 45.094
  },
  {
   "text": "The army tried again,",
   "s": 45.464,
   "e": 46.687
  },
  {
   "text": "and finally claimed a few hundred birds.",
   "s": 46.856,
   "e": 49.193
  },
  {
   "text": "But the emus kept coming back.",
   "s": 49.593,
   "e": 51.494
  },
  {
   "text": "In the end,",
   "s": 51.869,
   "e": 52.458
  },
  {
   "text": "farmers got a bounty system instead.",
   "s": 52.641,
   "e": 54.708
  },
  {
   "text": "And the great Emu War went down in history as a defeat for the army.",
   "s": 55.048,
   "e": 58.572
  },
  {
   "text": "Humans,",
   "s": 58.922,
   "e": 59.438
  },
  {
   "text": "zero.",
   "s": 59.671,
   "e": 60.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Emus,",
   "s": 60.435,
   "e": 60.906
  },
  {
   "text": "one.",
   "s": 61.097,
   "e": 61.491
  }
 ]
